flowchart TD
  A["单条可见、打开回执或点击已收到"] --> B["im.posts.markRead / im.posts.templateReceived"]
  B --> C["Venus/C++ JSON stringify 或 host observation"]
  C --> D["`im_post_read` / `im_template_received`"]
  D --> E["Helix V1 Tick/Effect 路径"]
  E --> F["`POST /api/cses/post/templateReceived` body `{postId}`；注意 Helix 入参读 camel `postId`"]
  F --> G["`post_update`"]
  G --> H["批量 raw DomainEvent 回调 C++"]
  H --> I["Venus owning-thread tick / MobileImSdk legacy reducer"]
  I --> J["JS/C++ 重建：模板已收到状态只在权威提交后出现，重复确认幂等，失败保留按钮"]
  E -. "Persist/HTTP/WS 失败" .-> X["raw failure event 或 SOURCE_MISSING"]
  X --> I
